 "discovery_notes": "Cell B430, follow-up 25 of B041 (reuses keys from 397/445/478/505/526/546/564/575/584/592/600/607/613). 25 standard searches; all claims from search summaries of Disney Pins Blog. New pins: HKDL Goofy Happy Birthday 2022 (LE 500, HK$149, May 2022 batch) and Ariel Pin Trading Nights 2022 jumbo (LE 600, HK$229). New sets (members held): HKDL Princess Designer Series (Apr 2021), SHDR Duffy Spring Hiking mystery 7 (date unclear). Avengers Mini vs Marvel Emblems: no source shows they are the same; field note added. No holds released; HKDL Jan 2022 six and Jan 2023 batch untouched. Resellers seen, not used: wizmouse, fryguypins, usshoppingsos, castleplanethk, wdwpinpals, dpinstore, thepinpal."
}